---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Tabs from "../components/Tabs.astro";

const { title } = Astro.props;
---

<BaseLayout title={"About the gallery"}>
  <section class="header-image">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h1>About the gallery</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="two-col-grid">
        <p class="grid-content">
          The Breakwater Gallery will be an outdoor art space at Port Taranaki,
          created by the people of Taranaki to highlight the extraordinary
          talent found in the region. This is a place where local creativity
          gets the stage it deserves. Where the work of our painters and
          muralists can be seen, felt, and celebrated by everyone who walks the
          breakwater.
        </p>

        <p class="grid-content">
          The vision is simple: to showcase and support local artists, and to
          give both locals and visitors a destination. Somewhere to slow down,
          look closely, and see Taranaki through the eyes of the people who
          create here. As the Gallery grows, it becomes more than a collection
          of artwork. It will become a landmark. An asset for the region,
          drawing people to our corner of Aotearoa, giving our creative
          community a platform to showcase talents, and adding something lasting
          to Taranaki's identity.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="decorative-swish">
        <img
          src="/src/images/Breakwater-Gallery-pattern.svg"
          alt=""
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h2>Be a part of the gallery</h2>
      <Tabs />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="light-gold-background">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h2>Founding Patrons</h2>
      <div class="two-col-grid">
        <div class="grid-content">
          <p>
            The success of the Breakwater Gallery depends on having great
            support from the community. Support from businesses and individuals
            like you, who can see the potential and are willing to take a risk.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every business, group or individual that joins as a supporter of The
            Breakwater Gallery in its first year will be recognised as our
            <span style="font-weight: 500;">“Founding Patrons”</span> in perpetuity.
           </p>
           <p>
            Our founding patrons will be provided a special area of recognition at the start of the
            Breakwater Gallery and become part of the gallery’s story. They will also be included in marketing promoting the gallery where space allows. 
          </p>
        </div>
<div class="grid-content">
  <img src="/src/images/founding-patron.webp" alt="Example of founding patrons recognition" />
</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .header-image {
      background-image: url("/src/images/Rectangle\ 239.jpg");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      height: 400px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: left;
    }

    h1 {
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
